    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6868425eee244082b1eaaefd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她这种不惜豁出性命的决心，\n让我心里也涌出了以后要\n像这样继续支持她的想法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e8f7f2860cabfb3b021e2761dac9a1ce52805c92cdb834fe6ee75f65e879722",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
